The '''Apprentice''' is an [[NPC]] that appears briefly in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} during the [[Mage Faction]] [[Crimson Isle Main Questline|Questline]].

== Quest ==
In the middle of the [[Mage Faction]]'s [[Crimson Isle Main Questline|Questline]], {{NPCSprite|Dean}} tasks the player with finding the apprentice, who was last seen by the {{Zone|Burning Desert}}. There, the player finds {{NPCSprite|Captain Ahone}}, who also tasks the player with finding the Apprentice, and gives out their [[Abiphone]] contact so they can be called when they are found.

The '''Apprentice''' can then be found just north of {{Zone|The Dukedom}}, lying on the floor. After calling {{NPCSprite|Captain Ahone}} about it, he, {{NPCSprite|Krevius}}, and {{NPCSprite|Grelius}} show up, splash him with healing potions, and then all four [[NPCs]] disappear. The player is then tasked with going back to {{NPCSprite|Dean}} with this information.

